WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.004 --> 00:00:07.006
"How's that?"

2
00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:26.677
Ally asked as she finished hanging a model of Earth's solar system from the ceiling.

3
00:00:26.697 --> 00:00:29.338
"Great!" Mateo said.

4
00:00:29.358 --> 00:00:32.000
"We're ready for our grand reopening!"

5
00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:36.153
"Not if Kate doesn't get back with the new menus," Ray said.

6
00:00:36.173 --> 00:00:40.454
"She just texted me," Bethany said.

7
00:00:40.474 --> 00:00:42.115
"She'll be here soon."

8
00:00:43.035 --> 00:00:43.715
Ally gulped.

9
00:00:45.816 --> 00:00:49.417
She'd been relieved when the diner had closed for a week to prepare for the reopening.

10
00:00:50.177 --> 00:00:51.657
There'd been no chance of Dr.

11
00:00:51.697 --> 00:00:53.238
Lloyd coming in with his granddaughter.

12
00:00:56.259 --> 00:00:57.779
But today was a different story.

13
00:00:58.359 --> 00:01:00.340
The two of them could enter at any moment.

14
00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:03.809
"Guess it's time to fire up the grill," Ray said.

15
00:01:04.349 --> 00:01:07.270
When Ally looked at him, she thought she saw tears in his eyes.

16
00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:10.551
"Thank you for all your help," he said.

17
00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:12.411
"I couldn't have done it without you.

18
00:01:13.051 --> 00:01:14.352
Especially you, Ally."

19
00:01:16.552 --> 00:01:19.753
"You're the one who makes the delicious food," she said.

20
00:01:19.773 --> 00:01:23.214
"New menus, hot off the press!"

21
00:01:23.874 --> 00:01:26.915
Kate came running in the back door and handed a menu to everyone.

22
00:01:26.935 --> 00:01:31.652
"The Cosmic Omelet sounds great," Bethany said.

23
00:01:31.672 --> 00:01:33.853
"So does the Beta Burgana!"

24
00:01:34.273 --> 00:01:35.454
Mateo said with a grin.

25
00:01:36.314 --> 00:01:37.715
Ally glanced at the main door.

26
00:01:37.735 --> 00:01:43.657
"It's time to open up."

27
00:01:44.077 --> 00:01:47.199
But when Mateo unlocked the door, no one was waiting to come in.

28
00:01:47.859 --> 00:01:50.080
The street out front was completely deserted.

29
00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.301
Ray came out of the kitchen, wringing his apron.

30
00:01:54.442 --> 00:01:55.242
"No one's here."

31
00:01:55.262 --> 00:01:59.644
"Don't worry, Papi, they'll come," Mateo said.

32
00:02:00.452 --> 00:02:01.792
"Uh-oh," Ally thought.

33
00:02:02.153 --> 00:02:04.893
But only seconds later, something amazing happened.

34
00:02:06.154 --> 00:02:09.215
A large bus with the words Space Life Tours pulled up.

35
00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:13.416
The door to the bus opened, and a large group of humans began to pile out.

36
00:02:14.296 --> 00:02:15.876
The bus driver introduced herself.

37
00:02:16.617 --> 00:02:20.258
"We run buses full of tourists every day to the UFO museum.

38
00:02:21.198 --> 00:02:26.039
We read Gourmet Greta's review and decided to bring our passengers here instead of Pepe's.

39
00:02:27.139 --> 00:02:28.620
I hope that's all right with you folks."

40
00:02:30.048 --> 00:02:31.409
"It's fantastic!"

41
00:02:31.889 --> 00:02:32.370
Ally said.

42
00:02:36.953 --> 00:02:38.774
The diner got busier by the hour.

43
00:02:39.235 --> 00:02:43.758
Carloads of people kept arriving, saying they'd read the review and couldn't wait to try the food.

44
00:02:43.778 --> 00:02:49.642
"Gourmet Greta has never steered us wrong," said one customer after the other.

45
00:02:50.223 --> 00:02:53.725
Mateo, Kate, and Bethany all jumped in to help take orders and clear tables.

46
00:02:55.927 --> 00:02:57.688
Ally looked around the packed dining room.

47
00:03:00.324 --> 00:03:02.626
"I'm glad I didn't give up," she thought.

48
00:03:02.646 --> 00:03:07.570
"After I buy the fuel and parts, I'll go home knowing I've accomplished something important."

49
00:03:09.972 --> 00:03:13.175
Late in the afternoon, things were quiet enough for Ally to take a break.

50
00:03:13.195 --> 00:03:18.200
"This would look so good on you!"

51
00:03:19.481 --> 00:03:21.242
Kate showed Ally an outfit on her phone.

52
00:03:26.527 --> 00:03:27.608
should totally buy it."

53
00:03:30.636 --> 00:03:31.997
"I can't.

54
00:03:32.377 --> 00:03:37.658
I have to save money for parts and Never mind!"

55
00:03:38.158 --> 00:03:42.740
Before Kate could ask what she meant, an older man who wore glasses and had a stern expression

56
00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:43.200
walked in.

57
00:03:48.302 --> 00:03:50.342
to Ray's," Ally greeted him.

58
00:03:50.362 --> 00:03:53.963
"Would you like to sit in a booth or at the counter?"

59
00:03:54.944 --> 00:03:56.104
The man peered at her.

60
00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.301
"I didn't come to eat.

61
00:04:01.021 --> 00:04:02.022
I came to see you.

62
00:04:02.962 --> 00:04:06.805
My granddaughter, Pearl, insisted that I come here and see you myself."

63
00:04:10.367 --> 00:04:13.429
He handed Ally his business card: Dr.

64
00:04:13.509 --> 00:04:18.672
Cosmo Lloyd Alien Life Expert Ally's heart began to race.

65
00:04:18.692 --> 00:04:20.333
"What should I do?"

66
00:04:20.653 --> 00:04:21.073
she thought.

67
00:04:21.093 --> 00:04:25.056
"I can't escape because my pod needs fuel.

68
00:04:26.548 --> 00:04:29.249
I'll just have to surrender and hope he treats me well."

69
00:04:30.249 --> 00:04:30.949
Ally sighed.

70
00:04:30.969 --> 00:04:34.570
"You've found out my true identity.

71
00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:38.671
So She held her hands out for him to handcuff her.

72
00:04:39.171 --> 00:04:39.672
But Dr.

73
00:04:39.692 --> 00:04:41.432
Lloyd burst into loud laughter.

74
00:04:43.973 --> 00:04:47.474
"Pearl told me you were very funny, and she was right.

75
00:04:47.874 --> 00:04:52.795
I came to ask if I can have my weekly meetings of the Sandville Astronomy Club here.

76
00:04:54.416 --> 00:04:57.637
There are about twenty of us, and we'd come every Wednesday."

77
00:04:57.657 --> 00:05:00.678
"Oh!" Ally was delighted.

78
00:05:00.698 --> 00:05:01.658
"Of course!

79
00:05:01.839 --> 00:05:03.499
I mean if Ray says it's okay!"

80
00:05:07.601 --> 00:05:09.282
Ray stepped forward to shake Dr.

81
00:05:09.302 --> 00:05:09.902
Lloyd's hand.

82
00:05:09.922 --> 00:05:11.463
"It would be my pleasure."

83
00:05:14.224 --> 00:05:18.005
That night Ally went to her pod and counted up all the money she'd earned so far.

84
00:05:18.026 --> 00:05:23.468
"Alpha, I've earned almost enough money for fuel and parts."

85
00:05:24.316 --> 00:05:27.617
"Goal will soon be accomplished," the computer replied.

86
00:05:30.938 --> 00:05:33.919
It went silent for a second before a blue light started blinking.

87
00:05:33.939 --> 00:05:36.959
"Detecting unhappiness."

88
00:05:36.979 --> 00:05:41.621
"Yes Ally sighed.

89
00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:45.962
"I mean, I'm happy that I've done so many good deeds for humans.

90
00:05:46.422 --> 00:05:49.743
That'll prove to my parents that I'm ready for a real mission.

91
00:05:50.743 --> 00:05:52.063
But I'll be sad to leave Earth.

92
00:05:52.644 --> 00:05:53.944
I kind of like it here."

93
00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.727
"Advice: play favorite song," the computer said.

94
00:05:58.747 --> 00:06:01.411
"Great idea!"

95
00:06:05.439 --> 00:06:07.863
Ally jumped up and danced her sadness away.
